	dc.b "PROBLEM   THE COMET DAMOCLES IS ON A COLLISION COURSE     WITH ERIS - SEE CHART D.1745 FOR TRAJECTORY    ",$00
	dc.b "HISTORY  A PARLIAMENTARY COMMITTEE HAS BEEN SITTING FOR  THE LAST THIRTY YEARS TO CONSIDER THE PROBLEM  AND HAS PUBLISHED MANY REPORTS - ALL TO NO AVAIL ",$00
	dc.b "SOLUTION RUMOUR HAS IT THAT THERE CAN BE AS MANY AS FIVE  WAYS TO SOLVE THE PROBLEM - THE ONLY PROGRESS  SO FAR WAS REPORTED BY PROFESSOR RALPH HANTZEN IN THE DEVELOPMENT OF AN IMMENSELY POWERFUL BOMB ",$00
	dc.b "SETBACK  UNFORTUNATELY THE ERIS STATE PRESIDENT AND THE  THE PROF HAD A FIERCE ARGUMENT FOLLOWING FROM AGAME OF CHESS - HANTZEN HAS NOT BEEN SEEN SINCE  ",$00
	dc.b "HANTZEN HEAD OF HANTZEN INDUSTRIES WHICH OPERATES AT THE FOREFRONT OF TECHNOLOGY WITH PRODUCTS RANGING   FROM TIN OPENERS TO TIME MACHINES (CRYOGENIC)   ",$00
	dc.b "OTHER    THE MYSTICAL ORDER OF CARPENTERS MAINTAIN THAT  A DEVICE GIVING ACCESS TO A PROFITABLE SOLUTION IS IN EXISTANCE - AND THE AUTHOR DOES CONCEED   THAT IF SO - SUCH A PROSPECT MAY NOT BE UNIQUE  ",$00
	dc.b "POLITICSTHE DION VERDANT PARTY -DARK GREEN CHAPTER- HAVEMOVED TO PLACE A PRESERVATION ORDER ON DAMOCLES! ",$00
	dc.b "REWARD  LLOYDS GROUP 4 HAVE OFFERED AN ADDITIONAL REWARD OF 25,000,000 ICG'S FOR THE SALVATION OF ERIS    IF ACHIEVED WITHOUT DESTRUCTION OF THE COMET   ",$00
	dc.b "REASON    LLOYDS CONSIDER DAMOCLES WILL BE A VALUABLE    TOURIST ATTRACTION ON PROJECTED FUTURE VISITS   ",$00
	dc.b "TIME     YOUR PANEL DISPLAY IS TUNED TO ERIS TIME TO GO     BEFORE DAMOCLES HITS - PLEASE NOTE THAT     INTERGALACTIC TRAVEL TAKES YOU VERY LITTLE TIME   BUT RAPIDLY DECAYS THE 'ERIS TIME' AVAILABLE   ",$00
	dc.b "NEXT    AFTER FULLY READING THIS FILE - PLEASE TAKE THE  ELEVATOR TO MY OFFICE IN THIS BUILDING LOCATED  AT THE END OF THE CORRIDOR ON THE SECOND FLOOR  ",$00
	dc.b $80,$06,$77,$80,$20,$00
	dc.b "THU 12THMONIQUE - LAST NIGHT I FIXED YOUR WORD PROCESSOR ",$00
	dc.b "FRI 13TH   MONIQUE  -  LETTER TO NOVAGEN AS FOLLOWS:     PAUL - I KNOW THERE'S EVERY REASON TO BE LATE   BUT I MUST HAVE THE FOUR DETONATORS COMPLETED    AND READY FOR ME TO PRIME BY THE 18TH LATEST            PARAGRAPH                              DAMOCLES IS DUE IN 2 WEEKS! - REGARDS - RALPH   ",$00
	dc.b "TUE 17TH MONIQUE - LETTER TO STATE PRESIDENT AS FOLLOWS   MY DEAR MARGARET - THANK YOU FOR YOUR LETTER            PARAGRAPH                             I DO KNOW THAT THERE ARE ONLY TEN DAYS TO GO ON   THE PROJECT FOR THE DESTRUCTION OF DAMOCLES             PARAGRAPH                               THE BOMB IS COMPLETE AND ALTHOUGH NOVAGEN IS  BEHIND SCHEDULE - THE DETONATORS WILL BE POSTED TO YOU AND THE THREE OTHER TRUSTEES IN GOOD TIME          PARAGRAPH                              I DO LOOK FORWARD TO OUR CHESS GAME NEXT WEEK            YOURS AFFECTIONATELY - RALPH           ",$00
	dc.b "WED 18THMONIQUE - DESPATCH DETONATORS TO TRUSTEES TODAY  ",$00
	dc.b "FRI 20TH MONIQUE - NONE OF THE DETONATORS HAVE ARRIVED!   PLEASE CHECK URGENTLY WITH ERIS POST OFFICE     I'M OFF TO THE COUNTRY HOUSE FOR THE WEEKEND   ",$00
	dc.b "TUE 24TH   MONIQUE - IT JUST WILL NOT DO TO KNOW THAT    ALL FOUR PARCELS HAVE BEEN TEMPORARILY LOST BY  THE POST OFFICE SORTING BRANCH ON SNOW ISLAND                     - - - - -                     THERE IS NO TIME TO MAKE ANY MORE DETONATORS!    I WANT POSITIVE RESULTS BY TOMORROW - RALPH                      - - - - -                     PS  I'M WITH THE STATE PRESIDENT THIS EVENING   ",$00
	dc.b "WED 25THMONIQUE - IF THAT */-#! PHONES - TELL HER I HAVEGONE ON HOLIDAY - AND NOT TO ERIS EITHER - RALPH ",$00
	dc.b $80,$04,$55,$80,$20,$00
	dc.b "SECRET  THIS INFO CLASSIFIED UNDER OFFICIAL SECRETS ACT THIS FILE IS CLASSIFIED AS TOP SECRET AND SHOULD  BE KEPT SECURE IN A LOCKED SAFE AT ALL TIMES   ",$00
	dc.b "PENALTY THE PENALTY FOR LEAKING ANY CONTENT OF THIS FILEIS 15 YEARS MINIMUM AT THE PAN HADES LABOUR CAMP ",$00
	dc.b "POWER   THE NOVABOMB OPERATES BEYOND PREVIOUS KNOWN LAWSOF PHYSICS - IS INSTANTANEOUS IN EFFECT - AND IS CAPABLE OF DESTROYING THE LARGEST OF PLANETS!   ",$00
	dc.b "PURPOSE      THE DESTRUCTION OF THE COMET DAMOCLES       ",$00
	dc.b "LOCATION KNOWN ONLY TO THE PROF FOR DELIVERY ON THE DAY  ",$00
	dc.b "METHOD   PLACE ON SURFACE OF COMET - REMOTE DETONATION!  ",$00
	dc.b "SAFETY  THE BOMB REQUIRES NO SPECIAL CONDITIONS IN STOREOR TRANSIT - IT EMITS A DETECTABLE LOW LEVEL OF  RADIATION AT LEVELS OK FOR 1 HOUR OF EXPOSURE!  ",$00
	dc.b "DETONATEFOUR INDIVIDUALLY CODED DETONATORS ARE NECESSARY EACH SWITCHED ON AND TRANSMITTING TO DETONATE   ",$00
	dc.b "DISGUISE   FOR ADDITIONAL SECURITY THE DETONATORS ARE        DISGUISED AS ORDINARY HOUSEHOLD ITEMS       ",$00
	dc.b "SECURITY THE INTEGRITY OF FOUR PROMINENT PEOPLE HOLDING DETONATORS AND A RELIABLE FIFTH HOLDING THE BOMB      MEETS GOVERNMENT SAFETY REGULATIONS        ",$00
	dc.b $80,$03,$3D,$80,$20,$00
	dc.b "ADMIN HQ  FROM ERIS POST OFFICE HQ 12-14 CAPITAL CITY     TO BRANCH SORTING OFFICER 00-03 SNOW ISLAND    DEAR BILL - YOU SEEM TO HAVE LOST FOUR PARCELS PLEASE SEND ME COPIES OF YOUR LOSS REPORT FORMS  ",$00
	dc.b "REPLY    TO ERIS POST OFFICE TEMPORARY HQ 00-10 BI DION  DEAR SID - ENCLOSED ARE COPY LOSS REPORT FORMS SEE YOU TOMORROW TO WATCH THE COMET ON TV - BILL ",$00
	dc.b "LOST 1  ADDRESSED ERIS STATE PRESIDENT- VESTA PARLIAMENT REFUSED DELIVERY AND ORDERED RETURN TO SENDER  THE PROFS NEW LAB ADDRESS TRACED - COPY ENCLOSED ",$00
	dc.b "LOST 2  SENT COMMISSIONER OF POLICE SELLERS ERIS CAPITALRETURNED TODAY MARKED 'GONE AWAY' AND HELD HERE  ",$00
	dc.b "LOST 3   TO WILBERFORCE K DODD - GOVENOR - BANK OF GAEA    WILL WRITE TO THE LOCAL POSTMAN FOR REPORT    ",$00
	dc.b "LOST 4  SENT TO LORD CHIEF JUSTICE PICKLES - NIC - METIS   WILL WRITE TO THE LOCAL POSTMAN FOR REPORT    ",$00
	dc.b $80,$02,$69,$80,$20,$00
	dc.b "PROPOSALTHE FOLLOWING SUMMARY IS OF PROPOSED LEGISLATION ",$00
	dc.b "PAPER 1 THE STATE PRESIDENT HAS PROPOSED A NEW TAX IDEA  A SIMPLE LEVY ON EVERY MEMBER OF THE COMMUNITY   AND BELIEVES THIS WILL BE ELECTORALY POPULAR   ",$00
	dc.b "PAPER 2 AN AMEMDMENT CLAUSE 56 TO LAWS ON PEOPLES RIGHTS CALLING FOR EQUAL OPPORTUNITY AND FREEDOM FOR       GREEN HAIRED PURPLE SKINNED QUADRUPEDS     PROVIDED THEY SUPPORT THE GAMMA SQUARE BALL TEAM ",$00
	dc.b "PAPER 3 THE GAMMA TRADE COMMISSION HAVE MOVED FOR AN END   TO THE LONG TRADITION OF TRADING POSTS IN          DEALING WITH ONLY ONE ITEM AT A TIME      STRONGLY OPPOSED BY THE MENTOR CHAMBER OF TRADE  ",$00
	dc.b $80,$00,$CB,$80,$20,$00
	dc.b "ANSWER          HELLO - THIS IS NOVAGEN SOFTWARE        DAMOCLES IS FINISHED AND WE ARE AWAY ON HOLIDAY CAN WE SUGGEST YOU BUY A BLUE BEACON LOCATOR AT MENTOR 02-01 - TO KEEP YOU BUSY UNTIL OUR RETURN ",$00
